{"id":"52376918bee1945e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-tred.md","title":"Turing 可约","display":"df-tred — Turing 可约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-tred","aliases":["20-df-tred"],"display":"df-tred — Turing 可约","chapter":"3","section":"3.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[89],"source_printed_pages":[53],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-tred"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-tred</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tred — Turing 可约"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>。归约的函数参数仅取全自然数值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{graph}\\)</span> 另外对任意部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tred}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_A(x)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{graph}(h):=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:x,y\\in\\omega\\land(x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nf\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [(x,y)\\in f\\land\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ g\\in\\omega^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tred}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_A(x)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{graph}(h):=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:x,y\\in\\omega\\land(x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nf\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [(x,y)\\in f\\land\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ g\\in\\omega^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数归约明确只比较全函数，所以下游全函数的归约条件不变。自然数集合与全自然数值函数的图不会重合；原先将非全函数左参数判为假的额外分支，在空函数同时又是空集合时会与集合归约冲突，故不再为该未使用分支赋值。图编码仍对任意部分函数定义，函数 oracle 的配对图编码没有改变。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.2.2；印刷页 53；PDF 第 89 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{graph}","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tred}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\chi_A(x)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{graph}(h):=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:x,y\\in\\omega\\land(x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nf\\le_TB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [(x,y)\\in f\\land\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ f\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(f,g\\in\\omega^\\omega),\\\\\nA\\le_Tg\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_T\\operatorname{graph}(g)\n\\quad(A\\subseteq\\omega,\\ g\\in\\omega^\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1897,"backlinks":[{"id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"96978d2a748174af","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"d387a906642794f7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"bd644b6a31616fc0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"17bb